OL,3,GNEWSAHealth board considers biggest
OL,4,Aservice shake-up for a generation
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth services in Powys could face
OL,7,Ftheir biggest shake-up in a generation,
OL,8,Fwith proposals to cut community
OL,9,Fhospital beds and concentrate services
OL,10,Fat fewer sites.
OL,12,FThere could be a reduction in the
OL,13,Fnumber of community hospital beds from
OL,14,F146 to either 90 across three hospitals
OL,15,For 60 across two.
OL,17,FA consultation could also bring changes
OL,18,Fto the location of local urgent care
OL,19,Fcentres and minor injury and illness
OL,20,Funits, while a separate proposal would
OL,21,Fbring all mental health inpatient beds
OL,22,Ftogether on a single site.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
